Package: colvR
Type: Package
Title: Poisson Lognormal with Dimension Reduction for Count Matrices with Missing Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Barbara", "Bricout", 
           email = "barbara.bricout@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The purpose of the package is to impute missing data in count tables using Poisson Lognormal with dimension reduction. The package offers two functions, one with and one without inflated zero.
